# ports/dos/patches/series: the patches applied to a copy of src/, in this order (tools/build.py), after the fixes of the
# original that every port takes (fixes/series at the repository root).
# `make FAITHFUL=1` applies none and must link the original program.
no-code-wheel.patch   # no code wheel question (ovl02 CheckCodeWheel); the random draw of its first question is kept
# speed patches (patches/speed/): the same game, faster on an 8088; tools/func.py shows the behaviour is the reference's
speed/unpack-rle.patch    # res05 UnpackRle in assembler: every DAX block the game loads
speed/tandy-glyph.patch   # res06 DrawGlyph's Tandy branch in assembler: all text
speed/tandy-blit.patch    # res07 the Tandy row loop of DrawPictureItem and DrawPictureItemClipped: 3D view tiles, sprites
speed/tandy-pictures.patch # res07 MirrorPicture and UnpackPicturePixels, Tandy branches: sprites facing left, every picture loaded
speed/tandy-fill.patch    # res06/res07/res09 window clears, the screen flush and new pictures by words (TP 6's FillChar and Move go a byte at a time)
speed/tandy-show.patch    # res07 ShowPicture's Tandy branch: pictures straight to the screen (portraits, title, symbols)
speed/walk-line.patch     # ovl30 WalkLine in assembler: the line of sight walks of combat targeting and the AI
speed/sort-table.patch    # ovl30 SortTable in assembler: the target list of every combat scan
